  <data name="label2.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Welcome to the Auto Motive Service Management System – a comprehensive software solution designed to streamline and manage all aspects of vehicle servicing operations. This application allows efficient tracking of service records, customer details, vehicle information, technician assignments, and billing processes.</value>
